<p>For a brief moment horrific hairs grow on your head, each of them ending with a creepy eye.</p><p>You use those eyes to gaze upon a target area, creatures caught inside partially turn to stone reducing their movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-4%, 32%, 49%, 58%, 64%</acronym> and making them brittle for 7 turns.</p><p>Brittle targets have a 35% chance for any damage they take to be increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30%, 40%, 47%, 54%, 60%.</acronym></p><p>This cannot be saved against.</p><p></p>